# ── OvenClear core: environment ──────────────────────────────────────────
# The offline core (tests, seed, self-test, verify-ledger, bench) needs NO env
# vars and NO network. This single key only switches the law-watch materiality
# classifier from the DeterministicMockAdapter to the real Gemini adapter
# (src/core/lawwatch/gemini.ts). It is never read by any test or CI path.
#
# Get from: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey  (Google AI Studio → API keys)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
